{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "uid": "gasometer",
  "title": "gasometer",
  "description": "How much of an EVM transaction fee was unnecessary, measured live on Base, Avalanche C-Chain and OP Mainnet.",
  "tags": [
    "gasometer",
    "evm",
    "fees"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### How much of each transaction fee was unnecessary\nEvery minute, on each network, gasometer prices a native transfer three ways and checks which blocks it would have landed in within 30 seconds. **Red is what was paid above the cheapest price that landed.** The fee model is built on Avalanche's [libevm](https://github.com/ava-labs/libevm), and C-Chain's base fee on [avalanchego](https://github.com/ava-labs/avalanchego)'s SAE gas clock."
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Share of a native transfer's fee, bids landing within 30 s",
      "description": "Each bar is 100% of what that bid paid, averaged over the selected range. Base fee, L1 data fee and the tip it needed are what the cheapest bid that landed in the same 30 s window paid; red is the rest. What senders pay is the median tip by gas of the latest block. Node's suggestion is eth_maxPriorityFeePerGas. gasometer bids the 0.99 quantile of the cheapest required tip in each recent 30 s window. The required tip is the 5th percentile tip by gas a block included (0th on C-Chain), an upper bound on what inclusion needed.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "label_join(label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(100 * ((label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(sum by (network, predictor, component) (increase(gasometer_required_usd_sum{tx=\"native\",horizon=\"30s\",predictor=~\"market|node|gasometer\"}[$__range])) / sum by (network, predictor, component) (increase(gasometer_required_usd_count{tx=\"native\",horizon=\"30s\",predictor=~\"market|node|gasometer\"}[$__range])), \"component\", \"Base fee\", \"component\", \"base_fee\"), \"component\", \"L1 data fee\", \"component\", \"l1_fee\"), \"component\", \"Tip it needed\", \"component\", \"tip\")) or (label_replace(sum by (network, predictor) (increase(gasometer_overpay_usd_sum{tx=\"native\",horizon=\"30s\",predictor=~\"market|node|gasometer\"}[$__range])) / sum by (network, predictor) (increase(gasometer_overpay_usd_count{tx=\"native\",horizon=\"30s\",predictor=~\"market|node|gasometer\"}[$__range])), \"component\", \"Overpaid\", \"\", \"\"))) / on (network, predictor) group_left () sum by (network, predictor) ((label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(sum by (network, predictor, component) (increase(gasometer_required_usd_sum{tx=\"native\",horizon=\"30s\",predictor=~\"market|node|gasometer\"}[$__range])) / sum by (network, predictor, component) (increase(gasometer_required_usd_count{tx=\"native\",horizon=\"30s\",predictor=~\"market|node|gasometer\"}[$__range])), \"component\", \"Base fee\", \"component\", \"base_fee\"), \"component\", \"L1 data fee\", \"component\", \"l1_fee\"), \"component\", \"Tip it needed\", \"component\", \"tip\")) or (label_replace(sum by (network, predictor) (increase(gasometer_overpay_usd_sum{tx=\"native\",horizon=\"30s\",predictor=~\"market|node|gasometer\"}[$__range])) / sum by (network, predictor) (increase(gasometer_overpay_usd_count{tx=\"native\",horizon=\"30s\",predictor=~\"market|node|gasometer\"}[$__range])), \"component\", \"Overpaid\", \"\", \"\"))), \"predictor\", \"What senders pay\", \"predictor\", \"market\"), \"predictor\", \"Node's suggestion\", \"predictor\", \"node\"), \"predictor\", \"gasometer\", \"predictor\", \"gasometer\"), \"network\", \"Base\", \"network\", \"base\"), \"network\", \"Avalanche C-Chain\", \"network\", \"cchain\"), \"network\", \"OP Mainnet\", \"network\", \"op\"), \"bar\", \" · \", \"network\", \"predictor\")",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "groupingToMatrix",
          "options": {
            "columnField": "component",
            "rowField": "bar",
            "valueField": "Value",
            "emptyValue": "zero"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "indexByName": {
              "bar\\component": 0,
              "Base fee": 1,
              "L1 data fee": 2,
              "Tip it needed": 3,
              "Overpaid": 4
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 90,
            "lineWidth": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Base fee"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#5794F2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "L1 data fee"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#B877D9"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Tip it needed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#73BF69"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Overpaid"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#F2495C"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "stacking": "normal",
        "xField": "bar\\component",
        "showValue": "never",
        "groupWidth": 0.8,
        "barWidth": 0.9,
        "fullHighlight": false,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Data collected",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "interval": "3m",
      "description": "Green while a network completes polls. Red where polls stalled or no data arrived, so the bars above cover less of the range.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(max by (network) (changes(gasometer_last_poll_timestamp_seconds[$__interval]) > bool 0), \"network\", \"Base\", \"network\", \"base\"), \"network\", \"Avalanche C-Chain\", \"network\", \"cchain\"), \"network\", \"OP Mainnet\", \"network\", \"op\")",
          "legendFormat": "{{network}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "insertNulls": 360000
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "red"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "Collecting",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "Stalled",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "No data",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "alignValue": "left",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "id": 3
    },
